Now, we'll compute the operation $z \otimes z$:
\begin{align*}
z \otimes z &= z^2+40 \\
&= \left ( r(cos \theta + isin\theta) \right )^2 + 40 \\
&= r^2(cos^2 \theta + 2isin\theta) + 40 \\
